        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 918R-F Victorian Design Door Stop</b>\r\n<p>\r\nConstructed of solid forged brass this very decorative  victorian style floor mount door stop adds a touch of wow to any room.  It is equally suited for use in private residential or high end commercial applications. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNot only is it very decorative, the floor mount design provides excellent protection for your walls and door hardware. Highly detailed victorian design, heavy and solid.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nOnly one hole to drill makes installation fast and easy.  Packaged with mounting hardware  for wood, tile or marble floor mount applications.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions 918R-F Victorian Design Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Floor base Diameter: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Diameter:  1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Color: Black</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Forged Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Brass</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued.</b> See available <a href=\"/collections/stops-bumpers\">Decorative Door Stops</a>.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
